  "findings": [
    "Sun and Bai Section 5.2 Equation (27) maps to AthenaK only when raw prtcl_j is treated as J_CR/c and the corrected volume-aware target is J_CR/c=2*B0*k0; artificial C must not multiply the target.",
    "The retained target-paper Bell benchmark is linear and supplies no standalone nonlinear saturation dataset or numeric nonlinear tolerance.",
    "The Q011 deck exactly overlaps the stated Sun-and-Bai Section 5.4 domain, AMR ladder, Mach number, gamma, eta, injection momentum, artificial C, ideal-surface injection, gas subtraction, and early-particle removal values.",
    "Sun and Bai Section 5.4 does not explicitly state P0; selected p0=1 is explicitly anchored to Bai et al. (2015).",
    "Bai et al. dynamic shock tracking, fiducial eta=2e-3 setup, larger domain, and CR-Hall scope are bounded discrepancies rather than exact Q011 matches."
  ],
